 "difference_id": "T3815731c",
 "property_summary": "For any non-empty arrays of recipients and amounts, c.transfer forwards exactly one call to the external callee for each recipient, so a recording helper receives the same number of calls as _tos.length; the mutant skips index 0 with i=1, so it records _tos.length - 1 calls.",
